{"_attachments":{},"_id":"app-builder","_rev":"603276-61f248916be0630f6928c33a","author":{"name":"Caleb Boyd","url":"https://github.com/calebboyd"},"description":"simple promise based middleware","dist-tags":{"latest":"7.0.4"},"license":"MIT","maintainers":[{"name":"calebboyd","email":"caleb.boyd@hotmail.com"}],"name":"app-builder","readme":"# app-builder\n\n[![Actions Status](https://github.com/calebboyd/app-builder/workflows/app-builder-ci/badge.svg)](https://github.com/calebboyd/app-builder/actions)\n\nCreate composable promise based middleware pipelines, using the \"onion\" middleware model.\n\n## Install:\n\n`npm install app-builder`\n\n## Example\n\n```javascript\nimport { compose } from 'app-builder'\n\nconst app = compose([\n  async function (ctx, next) {\n    ctx.value += 1\n    await next()\n    ctx.value += 4\n  },\n  async function (ctx, next) {\n    ctx.value += 2\n    await next()\n    ctx.value += 3\n  }\n]);\n\nconst context = { value: '' }\napp(context).then(() => console.log(context.value)) // --> '1234'\n\n```\n\nAll composed functions are also valid middleware functions.\n\n```javascript\nconst superApp = compose(\n  async function (ctx, next) {\n    ctx.value += 'first'\n    await next()\n    ctx.value += 'last'\n  },\n  app\n)\n```\n","time":{"created":"2022-01-27T07:24:01.733Z","modified":"2023-03-24T01:22:25.205Z","7.0.4":"2021-06-27T13:12:41.177Z","7.0.3":"2021-06-27T12:55:45.528Z","7.0.2":"2021-06-06T22:18:59.800Z","7.0.1":"2021-06-06T22:14:22.532Z","7.0.0":"2021-04-10T14:06:09.212Z","6.2.2":"2020-04-23T12:02:23.230Z","6.2.1":"2020-03-15T01:13:13.591Z","6.2.0":"2020-01-20T17:35:13.298Z","6.1.0":"2020-01-11T10:13:16.151Z","6.0.0":"2019-10-11T19:41:25.317Z","5.2.0":"2018-01-13T02:57:09.835Z","5.1.2":"2018-01-12T23:59:48.978Z","5.1.1":"2017-11-27T03:24:06.726Z","5.1.0":"2017-03-15T00:41:56.280Z","5.0.7":"2016-08-29T03:33:37.956Z","5.0.6":"2016-07-10T06:57:48.637Z","5.0.5":"2016-07-06T14:15:23.639Z","5.0.4":"2016-07-05T22:11:57.429Z","5.0.3":"2